invariant: INV-63
file: srv_parser.c
catches: tcp_blocking_loop_test
reason: the parser takes a hello without supported_versions, so the
  server answers with a supported_versions extension the hello did not
  carry, to a client that did not negotiate TLS 1.3
  (rfc9846.txt:1306-1313). test_reply_extensions expects the
  protocol_version alert alone for that hello.

--- old
    if ((seen & SRV_EXT_SUPPORTED_VERSIONS) == 0) {
        return srv_refuse(alert, ALERT_PROTOCOL_VERSION);
    }
--- new
